format 1

# actlith's own registry: the workflows this repository's CI runs,
# rendered by `actlith gen`. The gate kind runs the hk gate with the
# pr0d1r2 cache (nix T31, V21) on the three systems whose dev shell has
# the gate's tools: pklith has no x86_64-darwin build, so that shell
# lacks them and the gate cannot run there (nix C).

## workflows
id|kind|systems|cache|args
ci|gate|x86_64-linux, aarch64-linux, aarch64-darwin|pr0d1r2|-
